#   parser_1 - the CSS parser: parsing parameters, construction, stylesheets, @supports and
#              boolean expressions
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/Parser/Parser.cpp (lines 1-556): log_parse_error, the
#       ParsingParams constructors, Parser::create and its constructor, parsing a stylesheet
#       and its contents, convert_rules, parse_as_css_stylesheet, @supports conditions,
#       <boolean-expr>, container query conditions and <general-enclosed>.
#
#       C++ explicitly instantiates the TokenStream<T> templates for T = Token and T =
#       ComponentValue; here they are generics constrained by css_syntax.TokenStreamToken[T]
#       (see parser_2 for the per-T steps).
